    public function history(int $issuer,int $actor,int $ticket):array{return$this->tx(function()use($issuer,$actor,$ticket){$this->auth($issuer,$actor,'use');NativeCompanyTicketVisibility::assertTicket($this->db,$this->p,$issuer,$ticket);if(!$this->rows('SELECT id FROM '.$this->p.'company_tickets WHERE issuer_id=? AND id=? FOR UPDATE',[$issuer,$ticket]))throw new DomainException('company_ai_denied');$rows=$this->rows('SELECT * FROM '.$this->p.'company_ai_requests WHERE issuer_id=? AND actor_id=? AND ticket_id=? ORDER BY created_at DESC,request_key LIMIT 50',[$issuer,$actor,$ticket]);$out=[];foreach($rows as$r){$this->verify($r);$out[]=['request_key'=>$r['request_key'],'operation'=>$r['operation'],'status'=>$r['status'],'created_at'=>$r['created_at']];}return$out;});}
}
